name 'building-data-driven-systems-preassessment-q12_2025'

question 'A user wants to see only the "Action" movies in a large database. Which logic should the developer implement?'

wrong 'A `.sort()` function to move Action movies to the top.'
right 'A `.filter()` function that returns only objects where `genre === "Action"`.'
wrong 'A `.map()` function that changes all movie genres to "Action".'
wrong 'A `.push()` function to add more action movies to the array.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 8

Filtering is used to narrow down a dataset based on a specific condition without changing the items themselves.
MARKDOWN
